21. Regrets the significant deficiencies found by the Board of Auditors in the implementation of results-based budgeting in the United Nations, and in this regard urges the Secretary-General to address those deficiencies as a matter of priority;
22. Reaffirms its resolution 62/224 of 22 December 2007.
